<title>NEW ZEALAND: TABLE-Lyttelton yr profit rises 17 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Lyttelton yr profit rises 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   12.3 vs 10.5</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    12.1 vs 10.3</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			     3.5 vs 3.2</p>
<p>    Turnover				 52.2 vs 48.6</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			  18.3 vs 15.7</p>
<p>    Tax					 6.0 vs 5.3</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)    101.5 vs same</p>
<p>Note - Lyttelton Port Ltd operates the Lyttelton Port near Christchurch.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
<p>	 e-mail wellington.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
